      },
      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$E = (3x + 1)^2 - (x - 2)^2$",
          "$E = (9x^2 + 1 + 6x) - (x^2 + 4 - 4x)$",
          "$E = 9x^2 + 1 + 6x - x^2 - 4 + 4x$"
        ],
        "result": "E = 8x^2 + 10x - 3"
